{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical:\n\n1. **Brightdesk**: A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n2. **Orbitly**: Teams use its forms and boards as a basic request tracker.\n3. **Halcyon Sales**: Focused on selling, with only basic ticket handling.\n4. **Kestrel CRM**: No support features yet.\n\nA quick way to decide: Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Orbitly is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f4-72dd-8756-d7dee875aeb0","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:58.300Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm with support inbox"],"latency_ms":9330,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[142,152],[440,450]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[226,233],[488,495]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[301,314]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a38